The texgyreheros-*.otf, texgyretermes-*.otf and texgyrecursor-*.otf files
(regular, bold, italic, bolditalic) are TeX Gyre Heros, Termes and Cursor,
version 2.004, unchanged, from
http://www.gust.org.pl/projects/e-foundry/tex-gyre/ (qhv2.004otf.zip,
qtm2.004otf.zip, qcr2.004otf.zip).

Copyright 2007--2009 for TeX Gyre extensions by B. Jackowski and
J.M. Nowacki (on behalf of TeX Users Groups). Vietnamese characters were
added by Han The Thanh. TeX Gyre Heros, Termes and Cursor are based on
URW's Nimbus Sans L, Nimbus Roman No9 L and Nimbus Mono L, released by
URW++ Design and Development Inc. under the GFL.

